  "title": "Amazing Lemon Scones",
  "description": "These luscious lemon scones are deliciously rich and buttery, topped with a tangy lemon glaze for a pleasing sweet treat for brunch or afternoon tea.",
  "authors": [
    "ANGELSTAR"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:51:46-04:00",
