  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.33333334326744 cup white sugar",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking soda",
    "0.33333334326744 teaspoon salt",
    "0.75 cup cold butter, cut into pieces",
    "9 tablespoons milk",
    "3 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "2.5 teaspoons lemon zest",
    "1.5 teaspoons vinegar",
    "2 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup butter, melted",
    "2.5 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 tablespoons water, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bk5hSZTcpWvzxaO0PonlvpiZ60s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229571-amazing-lemon-scones-DDMFS-step-01-50f2ebe54cbf4151bcfb09629bd22387.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229571/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the scones: Whisk flour, sugar, baking powder, baking soda, and salt together in a large bowl. Cut in cold butter with 2 knives or a pastry blender until mixture resembles coarse crumbs. Whisk milk, lemon juice, lemon zest, and vinegar in a small bowl; stir into flour mixture until dough is moistened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q8qNZ9J7P4hypRBKNKcCZ6BEOjA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229571-amazing-lemon-scones-DDMFS-step-02-51c492db1ad4457ba8d4afe93e5963d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229571/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn dough out onto a lightly floured surface and knead briefly, 5 or 6 turns.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WJ4KEkjJeptkVJZqvNxtUzWZHJE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229571-amazing-lemon-scones-DDMFS-step-03-d991fbe4cae548cd813236c02eb13327.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229571/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pat or roll dough out into a 1-inch-thick round. Cut into 10 wedge-shaped pieces; arrange 1 inch apart on a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Tmg4n7qYJgVYkQDdPgKhPt0whk8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229571-amazing-lemon-scones-DDMFS-step-04-c9d699c20b3b43b3b34b8e2e85237f31.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229571/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until bottom edges are golden brown, 12 to 15 minutes. Cool scones on a wire rack for 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w-OSKpBNNcGyLRF9ElAExy1_nAI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229571-amazing-lemon-scones-DDMFS-step-05-fad2d70f0f854c87b316eccbeec68daa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229571/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, to make the lemon glaze: Stir confectioners' sugar, melted butter, lemon juice, and vanilla together in a bowl until smooth. Stir water into sugar mixture, 1 tablespoon at a time, to make a glaze; drizzle glaze over warm scones.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fBX-AfHfiSeyldY44VMy4TBIqLc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229571-amazing-lemon-scones-DDMFS-step-06-758a230c378d409cb2dde99f5954ed60.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229571/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
